OL,6,     F3/3. David Edgar's modern theatre
OL,7,     Fclassic has been reworked into a
OL,8,     Fpowerful three part series
OL,9,     Fexploring the shift of idealistic
OL,10,     Fyoung activists from the far left
OL,11,     Fto the die-hard right.
